  "body": "The final home in this exclusive boutique collection - and arguably the one you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nElevated above one of Takapuna's most coveted streets, this exceptional residence delivers a rare combination of architectural design, effortless luxury and a truly walkable lifestyle. With the majority of the development already sold, Lot 6 is your final opportunity to secure one of these outstanding homes.\r\n\r\nDesigned for those who appreciate space, quality and convenience, this sophisticated four-bedroom, four-bathroom residence is spread across multiple levels and connected by a private internal lift, creating an exceptional level of comfort for everyday living.\r\n\r\n **Luxury Without Compromise**\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully appointed kitchen featuring premium Miele appliances, generous cabinetry and a sleek contemporary finish. Open-plan living and dining flow effortlessly to the outdoor spaces, creating the perfect setting for relaxed family living or sophisticated entertaining.\r\n\r\nEach of the four bedrooms enjoys its own ensuite, offering privacy and convenience rarely found in townhouse living. A separate lounge provides another versatile living zone - perfect as a media room, retreat or quiet space to unwind.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the view.\r\n\r\nThe elevated position captures beautiful sea views, best enjoyed from the enclosed balcony - an inviting space to enjoy your morning coffee, evening wine or simply watch the world go by.\r\n\r\n**Designed Around Your Lifestyle**\r\n\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms\r\n* 4 beautifully appointed bathrooms\r\n* Private internal lift servicing all levels\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Premium Miele kitchen appliances\r\n* Separate lounge / additional living area\r\n* Enclosed balcony with elevated water views\r\n* Freehold title\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n* Brand-new construction\r\n* Boutique development with the majority already sold\r\n\r\n**Takapuna at Your Doorstep**\r\n\r\nThis is more than a beautiful home - it is a lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStroll to Takapuna Beach, enjoy the cafés, restaurants and boutique shopping, or take advantage of the area's excellent schools, transport links and vibrant coastal atmosphere.\r\n\r\nFew locations offer this level of convenience, and even fewer brand-new homes combine four ensuited bedrooms, a private lift, double garaging and seaviews in such a central Takapuna position.\r\n\r\nLot 6 is the final opportunity. Once it's gone, it's gone.\r\n\r\nSecure the last residence in this exclusive collection and make Takapuna your address.",
